ments including the flute and the clarinet, as well as various kinds of percussion. \r\n\r\nBorn 30 September 1954 in Los Angeles, California, USA. Her signature sound can be described as a sophisticated composition of R&B, jazz, and funk styles. When she was 17, Ms. Rushen and her band won a competition that earned them a spot at the Monterey Jazz Festival, which earned her a recording contract with Prestige Records in 1973. After recording three albums and becoming an in-demand session player, with artists that included [a=Jean-Luc Ponty], Rushen signed with Elektra Records in 1978.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:21262","relations":{"aliases":[{"id":9369865,"name":"Mumbi"}],"groups":[{"active":false,"id":839592,"name":"Richard S. & The Vibe Tribe"},{"active":true,"id":1122254,"name":"The Meeting"},{"active":true,"id":1346499,"name":"The Little Nice Girls"},{"active":true,"id":1719674,"name":"Sugar Loaf Express"},{"active":false,"id":1951421,"name":"The Stanley Clarke Trio"},{"active":true,"id":2037487,"name":"The Gentle Thoughts"},{"active":true,"id":5341909,"name":"SBPR"},{"active":true,"id":6146273,"name":"CAB (13)"},{"active":true,"id":10953626,"name":"Putter Smith Quintet"}],"members":null,"namevariations":["P Rushen","P Rushenl","P. L. Rushen","P. Rushen","P. Rusher","P.L. Rushen","P.Rushen","Patrice L. Rushen","Patrice Ruchen","Patrice Rusheen","Patrice Rushen = パトリース・ラッシェン","Patrice Rusten","PatriceRushen","Patricia Rushen","Patrick Rushen","Prushen","Rushden","Rushen","Rushess","パトリス・ラッシェン","パトリース・ラッシェン"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/21262-Patrice-Rushen","type":"artist","urls":["http://patricerushen.com","http://www.allmusic.com/artist/patrice-rushen-mn0000743968/biography","http://patricerushen.bandcamp.com","http://www.facebook.com/Plr88keys","http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0750725","http://www.instagram.com/patrice.rushen","","http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Patrice_Rushen","http://www.youtube.com/@patricerushenv